1. Project-এর main purpose কী?

"Our project aims to reduce food waste by connecting restaurants, customers and charities. Restaurants can provide surplus food for charity, customers can purchase available food, and charities can receive donated food."

2. Hashing কোথায়?

hashPassword() function-এ।

3. Password কখন hash হয়?

Registration এবং Login—দুই সময়েই।

4. Inheritance কোথায়?

Customer, Restaurant, Charity, Admin → User থেকে inherit করেছে।

5. Encapsulation কোথায়?

User এবং FoodItem class-এর data members private/protected রেখে getter/setter ব্যবহার করেছি।

6. Charity কী করে?

Charity donation food দেখতে পারে এবং available donated food receive করতে পারে।

